# Doctor Doom: "As long as you control an artifact creature or a Plan, Doctor Doom has indestructible." Bot1 casts it on turn 1
# (Black Lotus's {B}{B}{B} and three Moxen) and it is indestructible with its Doombots. On turn 2 Bot2's two Lightning Bolts kill the
# Doombots and Doom is not indestructible. On turn 3 Bot1 casts Doom Reigns Supreme (Enchantment - Plan) with two Moxen: with no
# artifact creature, only the Plan, Doom has indestructible again.

